REPOSITORY
----------

  Name:        plumlang/pygments-plum
  What it is:  The Plumlang lexer plugin for Pygments, published on PyPI
               as `pygments-plum`: syntax highlighting for Plumlang in
               Sphinx, MkDocs, pygmentize and anything else that uses
               Pygments.

